DTSTAMP:20260905T180655Z
SUMMARY:HOWARD PARK SUMMER CONCERT SERIES
LOCATION:Howard Park | 219 S St Louis Blvd | South Bend\, IN 46617
DESCRIPTION:Indulge in the vibrant sounds of summer and join us at our FREE
  Summer Concert Series at Howard Park! Every other Thursday evening (6-8p
 m) from June to September\, you’ll have a chance to enjoy live music\, 
 fun community nights\, and rotating food trucks with your friends and fam
 ily – just bring a blanket or chair and your Thursday evening plans are
  set! The performer lineup is as follows:\n\n- June 4 – PT and the Crui
 sers\n- June 18 – The Erly\n- July 2 – Equipo Elevado\n- July 16 – 
 Why Not Both\n- July 30 – Jazz Assemblage\n- August 13 – Happy Camper
 s\n- August 27 – The Resurrection Blues Band\n- September 10 – Hippos
 onics\n\nSee you there!\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/even
 ts/howard-park-summer-concert-series/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/howard-park-summer-concert-series
 /
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270611T180000
