UID:70f79036e00afc09bf75e994@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260905T180655Z
SUMMARY:MURDER AT THE MORRIS
LOCATION:Morris Performing Arts Center | 211 N Michigan St | South Bend\, 4
 6601
DESCRIPTION:Step into the glamour\, intrigue\, and danger of the Roaring Tw
 enties at Murder at the Morris\, an immersive dinner gala fundraiser unli
 ke any other. Set during the height of Prohibition\, this interactive mur
 der mystery transforms the historic Palais Ballroom into a world of jazz\
 , hidden secrets\, bootleggers\, and high society. Enjoy an elegant dinne
 r\, bid in the silent auction\, and become part of the story as the myste
 ry unfolds around you.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/event
 s/murder-at-the-morris1/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/murder-at-the-morris1/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260910T183000
