SUMMARY:RAISING ARIZONA (1987)
LOCATION:DeBartolo Performing Arts Center\, 100 Performing Arts Center | No
 tre Dame\, 46556
DESCRIPTION:Browning Cinema Crime\, Blood\, and Laughs: The Coen Brothers D
 irected by Joel Coen With Nicolas Cage\, Holly Hunter\, John Goodman Rate
 d PG-13\, 94 minutes\, Blu-ray Herbert I. "Hi" McDunnough (Nick Cage) is 
 a petty thief who finds himself in and out of Arizona prisons for knockin
 g off gas stations. While being processed one day\, he meets and falls in
  love with Ed (Holly Hunter) \, a cop who takes his mugshots. Marital lif
 e reforms Hi\; however\, when tests show he is infertile and unable to ad
 opt\, Ed pushes her spouse to go back and get her a toddler at whatever c
 ost. Sponsored by the Meg and John P. Brogan Endowment for Classic Cinema
 .\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/raising-arizona-198
 7/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/raising-arizona-1987/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260908T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260908T210000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
