  7:05 p.m.\n\n\nThis limited package includes a ticket to the game\, an e
 xclusive Bar Crawl T-Shirt including all of the bars\, and two drink vouc
 hers for fans 21+.\n\n\n**Important Event Details & Requirements:**\nMUST
