 hirt and wristband pick up will be at Four Winds Field day of the event\n
 \n\nAssociated Bars:\nSouth Bend Cubs\nManny's\nShamrocks\nBrothers\nCorb
 y's\nCJ's Pub\nBrew Works\nLa Esperanza\nFinnies\n\nMore Info: https://ww
 w.visitsouthbend.com/events/south-bend-cubs-bar-crawl/
